Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.39,0:04:45.49,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Das hier bitte.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.60,TypePlaceholder,INSERT,0,0,0,,{\pos(426.338,205.927)\org(426.338,205.927)\an7\fscx38.259\fscy80.274\frz21.707\frx21.666\fry14.977\fax-0.017\fay0\q2\fnImpact\fsp1\bord1\1c&H2e13e9&\3c&H000000&}Charakter-{\1c&H1df430&}Lotterie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:46.60,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Hier bitte.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:48.75,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Mist!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:53.02,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Im Ernst jetzt?!\NIch hab meinen Geldbeutel vergessen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.79,0:04:58.92,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Das ist alles, was ich noch habe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:03.30,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Was davon nehm ich jetzt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:08.91,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Entschuldigen Sie, aber Sie scheinen den\NAssassin-Detektiv wohl sehr zu lieben.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:09.94,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.94,0:05:12.29,Default,Koshiba,0,0,0,,Nee, der ist mir egal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.29,0:05:12.79,Default,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.75,TypePlaceholder,INSERT,0,0,0,,{\pos(215.421,160.49)\an7\fscx75.994\fscy101.529\frz-9.741\frx-0.334\fry14.921\fax0.209\fay0\q2\fnImpact\fsp1\bord1\1c&H2e13e9&\3c&H000000&}Charakter-{\1c&H1df430&}Lotterie
